     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorFunctionalRequirements</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorFunctionalRequirements\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorFunctionalRequirements\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"FREQ-01\"> </a></b>Define functional requirements from L1</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can define functional requirements based on L1 recommendations in terms of health content, decision-support, and scheduling logic.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"FREQ-02\"> </a></b>Define non-functional requirements</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can define non-functional requirements including user-friendliness and cybersecurity, informed by implementer best practices.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"FREQ-03\"> </a></b>Link requirements to personas</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can link each functional requirement to the correct persona and business process activity.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"FREQ-04\"> 